  "bodyHash": "67dea841f84a287f",
  "content": "\n\n<p>模組由 Aes Efficio Development Group 製作 <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/r4Knci2k/images/7213f4ce1c84436eea0c31e9579395b8f1d6aefe.png\" alt=\"banner_image\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">![star](</a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fStar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/Star</a> on GitHub-fafbfc?logo=github&amp;logoColor=black) <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ynQvWygqQT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865f2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"discord\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>Create: Interiors 為現代建築師提供了一套實用且高度可自訂的創新工具方塊；現已支援 Forge 與 Fabric！</strong></p>\n<h2>功能列表：</h2>\n<h2>• 椅子方塊</h2>\n<p><em>共有 16 種 Minecraft 染料顏色</em></p>\n<p><em>用扳手右鍵點擊可循環切換扶手狀態（無、僅左側、僅右側、或雙側都有）</em></p>\n<p><em>可由 1 個染色羊毛 + 2 個木質台阶，或 1 個染色座椅 + 1 個木質台阶 製作</em></p>\n<p><em>可乘坐，無論是附著於機組還是單獨放置皆可使用</em></p>\n<p><em>可像座椅方塊一樣拾取實體</em></p>\n<p><em>具有彈性！</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k1JDWLC/resized-colors.gif\" alt=\"chair_colors\"> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bJs9sQr/resized-armrests.gif\" alt=\"chair_armrests\"></p>\n<h2>• 矮腳椅方塊</h2>\n<p><em>與椅子方塊相同，但沒有椅腿</em></p>\n<p><em>可由 1 個染色羊毛 + 2 個木質台阶，或 1 個染色座椅 + 1 個木質台阶 製作</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RHyNcbG/Untitled.png\" alt=\"chair_colors\"></p>\n<h2>• 海帶座椅</h2>\n<p><em>比羊毛椅子更便宜、更容易farm的替代方案</em></p>\n<p><em>可由 1 個曬乾的海帶 + 1 個木質台阶 製作</em></p>\n<p><em>功能與 Create 的座椅方塊完全相同</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zb4mnhW/kelp-seat.png\" alt=\"kelp_seat\"></p>\n<h2>• 海帶椅子</h2>\n<p><em>比羊毛座椅更便宜、更容易farm的替代方案</em></p>\n<p><em>可由 1 個曬乾的海帶 + 2 個木質台阶，或 1 個海帶座椅方塊 + 1 個木質台阶 製作</em></p>\n<p><em>功能與染色椅子完全相同</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/71FCSBf/resized-kelp-chair.gif\" alt=\"kelp_armrests\"></p>\n<h2>• 海帶矮腳椅</h2>\n<h2>• 座椅木木板</h2>\n<p><em>搭配 Copycat 階梯與 Copycat 面板，作為座椅與椅子的裝飾用途</em></p>\n<p><em>3 個座椅木木板可由 2 個木質台阶 + 2 個木製木板 製作</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rm5scrg/seatwood.png\" alt=\"seatwood\"></p>\n<h2>貢獻者！</h2>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lopyluna/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Luna</a> 設計了精美的圖標 :)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/AsseyGithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@AsseyGithub</a> 將 Create: Interiors 翻譯為韓文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/rim4oo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@rim4oo</a> 將 Create: Interiors 翻譯為俄文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p>##</p>\n<h3>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finteriors%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上探索 Create: Interiors</h3>\n<h4>在此 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/CreateInteriorsMod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">回報問題</a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/Q8SRA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VpBf0xs/interiors.png\" alt=\"Interiors Banner\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fowasp.umn.edu%252falexander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexander Weimer</a> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fa0.ax%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/a0ax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252falexander-weimer%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LinkedIn</a> · <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9cVn1s0AAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Scholar</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.researchgate.net%252fprofile%252fAlexander-Weimer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResearchGate</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252forcid.org%252f0009-0009-7313-138X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ORCiD</a> · <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjyse.org%252farticles%252ferror-corrected-deep-learning-gregg-shorthand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文章</a></p>",
